    description: "PR #1528 fixed Rust register_symbol to stop registering short names (suffix index handles lookups). Same collision-prone pattern exists in C++ Scala Swift Ruby Groovy C# Elixir (unconditional overwrite) and Perl Hack Apex Luau (guarded but order-dependent). Fix: remove short-name registration from all, rely on suffix index."  # f121
