  message: "Fixed in PR #1530. Removed short-name registration from register_symbol in 11 languages (C++, Scala, Swift, Ruby, Groovy, C#, Perl, Elixir, Hack, Apex, Luau). Extended suffix index to handle all separators (::, ., #, \\, :). Also fixed Hack namespace propagation and Elixir multi-clause dispatch preservation."  # c782
